    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nWelcome to 63 Congress Avenue, a charming terraced residence ideally situated in one of Drogheda's most established and convenient locations. This well laid out home offers bright and versatile accommodation throughout and the valuable addition of a private parking space.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a welcoming entrance hall with convenient under-stairs storage. To the front of the property is a spacious living room, creating an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining. The living room features a fireplace, adding warmth and character to the space.\r\n\r\nMoving towards the rear of the property, an inner hallway leads to the generously proportioned kitchen, which enjoys excellent natural light and provides ample space for cooking and dining. Off the kitchen is a practical utility room, offering valuable additional storage and laundry facilities. A well-appointed ground floor bathroom completes the accommodation on this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the first floor comprises a central landing leading to two well-sized double bedrooms. Both bedrooms offer comfortable accommodation, with Bedroom 2 benefiting from built-in wardrobe storage. The layout provides an ideal balance of privacy and functionality for homeowners, first-time buyers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a designated parking space, a highly sought-after feature in this mature residential area. The home enjoys a convenient location within walking distance of local shops, schools, transport links and Drogheda town centre.\r\n\r\nBER Rating D"
      },
